---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "July 16, 2026";
---

<Layout
	title="Terms of Use — Twilight"
	description="Terms of use for the Twilight macOS app."
>
	<article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Terms of Use</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

		<div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
			<p>
				Twilight is distributed through the Mac App Store, so Apple's
				<a
					href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/"
					class="text-white underline underline-offset-2"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a>
				applies to your use of the app in addition to the terms below.
			</p>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Use of the app</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
					You're free to use Twilight on any Mac where you're signed in with the Apple ID that
					licensed it, subject to Apple's standard terms for App Store purchases and family sharing.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">No warranty</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
					Twilight is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind. It adjusts your display's
					color output using standard, public macOS APIs, but I can't guarantee it will be free of
					bugs or compatible with every display or Mac configuration.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Limitation of liability</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
					To the extent permitted by law, I'm not liable for any indirect, incidental, or
					consequential damages arising from your use of Twilight.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Changes</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
					These terms may be updated from time to time; the "last updated" date above will reflect
					the latest revision.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
					Questions about these terms can be sent to
					<a href="mailto:nandanvarma.me@gmail.com" class="text-white underline underline-offset-2">nandanvarma.me@gmail.com</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>
